[enu default]

Duel = "Threshold";
Duel_01a = "\cI[Accept Single Combat challenge]";
Duel_01c = "\cI[Ring the bell]";
Duel_02 = "\cDWhat is a Duel?";
Duel_03 = "\cD[Examine this Domain]";

DUEL_01_PRE =
"\cDThere are many vague verses and passages about a terrible horror that wields the power of aeromancy.\n\n"
"\One passage suggests it resides in a plane of thoughts.";

DUEL_01_DLG_01 =
"\cDHere lies a point where two horizons may connect. What lurks beyond is a construction of ritual. "
"The cosmoi may speak to one another within this wondrous space.\n\n"
"Many before have departed from their bodies searching for communion with the other world, chasing a song our ears can never hear. "
"It is a command called forth at an instinctual level, no different than a survival response.\n\n"
"But it is at its peak where contact is made, that all are swept away by the current.";

DUEL_01_DLG_02 =
"\cDWithin this domain is a maelstrom of thoughts. Flashing forth momentarily are fragments of truth, and the whirling "
"roars that follow are statements of celebration. An old dilemma resolved at last, a new concept seeded... "
"But there is nothing for them to cling to, and thus, they are taken back to the darkness.\n\n"

"Present at the center of this domain is a creature resonating with a divine harmonic. "
"This being has survived the ritual, withstanding the abyssal tempest and the overflowing torrent of the heavens. "
"Its ontological existence is a dual aspect of the world within and the one beyond. The creature embodies the raw "
"essence of energy; its aggression is indiscriminate, a flowing river of vitality demanding to be sprung forth.";

DUEL_01_DLG_03 =
"\cDDuels are optional combat encounters against powerful entities that have ascended beyond the normal state of being. Their mutated bodies, "
"reformed through resonance with a higher order, make them \cRinvulnerable to conventional damage\cD.\n\n"
"\cDHowever, most of their attacks are desynchronized from the ebb and flow of this near perfect state. If you can inflict a "
"precise counterattack with the \cITrench Gun\cD in the middle of their attacks, then you will trigger a \cIResonance Break\cD -- "
"overloading their senses and grounding them to your reality.";

DUEL_01_DLG_03B =
"\cDDuels are optional combat encounters against powerful entities that have ascended beyond the normal state of being. Their mutated bodies, "
"reformed through resonance with a higher order, make them \cRinvulnerable to conventional damage\cD.\n\n"
"\cDHowever, most of their attacks are desynchronized from the ebb and flow of this near perfect state. If you can inflict a "
"precise counterattack with the \cITrench Gun\cD in the middle of their attacks, then you will trigger a \cIResonance Break\cD -- "
"overloading their senses and grounding them to your reality.\n\n"
"\cF(Physique) \cDDue to the nature of your origin, you can ignore these ruleset. Your damage will always register.";

DUEL_02_DLG_01 =
"\cDHere lies a point where two horizons may connect. What lurks beyond is a construction of union. "
"The cosmoi may speak to one another within this wondrous space.\n\n"
"Many before have departed from their bodies searching for communion with the other world, chasing a song our ears can never hear. "
"It is a command called forth at an instinctual level, no different than a survival response.\n\n"
"But it is at its peak where contact is made, that all are swept away by the current.";

DUEL_02_DLG_02 =
"\cDWithin this domain lies the embodiment of neither day nor night, but the sunset and sunrise. It is the intermediate state "
"that sits parallel to death, the highest reality. An image of a living opposing force -- existing beyond the inconceivable "
"darkness. It is somehow paradoxical in nature, yet true in every sense.\n\n"

"Present at the center of this domain is a dualistic vessel containing the primordial feminine and masculine energy. "
"The external chosen form is feminine, while the internal unseen form is masculine. This entity embodies the "
"transformational state of being, existing to test and bring forth the greatest danger, so that all those who could "
"endure may rise to a new height.";

DUEL_03_DLG_01 =
"\cDHere lies a point where two horizons may connect. What lurks beyond is a construction of paradox. "
"The cosmoi may speak to one another within this wondrous space.\n\n"
"Many before have departed from their bodies searching for communion with the other world, chasing a song our ears can never hear. "
"It is a command called forth at an instinctual level, no different than a survival response.\n\n"
"But it is at its peak where contact is made, that all are swept away by the current.";

DUEL_03_DLG_02 =
"\cDWithin this domain is the tension of contrast. What awaits here is the ultimate blindspot of all awareness. "
"From the edges of forms -- a vague image is constructed in unknowable depths, expelled from two worlds.\n\n"
"Present at the center of this domain is a being of inverted orientation. The outside world surrenders all "
"of its truths at an instant. What stands before it is the opposite -- absurd, irregular, looming shadow.";


DUEL_QUEST =
"\cDThis journal is written in a strange language. Some words you recognize and others a weird mish-mash of characters.\n\n"
"You can't make sense of this.\n\n"
"Perhaps it would be wise to take this with you; someone could translate it...";

DUEL_NOTE =
"Engaging in a battle against a Class III meta-lifeform is a perilous test of timing and precision. Amongst all accounts of encounters against these entities, "
"some points that are often unanimously agreed upon are:\n\n"
"\cR-Blindly attacking is a shortcut to the grave. \cJObserve your opponent and memorize their maneuvers before engaging. "
"\cDSwift, short dodges are particularly useful here.\n\n"
"\cR-Sprinting around is useless. \cJThese beings perceive time and space differently. They can close the distance within an instance. You'll only waste energy.\n\n"
"\cF-Each being have one truly devastating attack. \cJThis attack cannot be countered, it can only be avoided through a well-timed disengagement. "
"\cDAn Aerial Dash is a known favored technique for such an event.";

/*"Those seeking ascension are overwhelmed by the loudness of the song. They feel the beat all over them, "
"they desperately try to make sense of the melody sung to them, to try and understand where the song goes, "
"but they just can't. They will go mad while the song fills their soul, and they are unable to sing. Alas, "
"they are fragmented, drifting in-between two worlds for eternity.\n\n"